    <head>Organization and Arrangement</head>
<p>Arranged in the following series: <list type="ordered"><item>Autobiographical and biographical material, 1921-74.</item><item>Photographs, 1925-68.</item><item>Correspondence, 1928-84.</item><item>Professional societies, 1956-77.</item><item>Manuscripts and lectures, 1963-74.</item><item>Publications, 1926-78; Awards, 1919-66; Miscellany, 1934-75. </item></list></p>  </arrangement>
